.env
.env.*
# .claude is ignored by default (local session/worktree/settings state),
# but project subagent definitions must be tracked so they ship with the
# repo -- see docs/workflow/WORKFLOW_AUDIT.md (Part 9 reconciliation).
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
!.claude/agents/**

